; MARK: 3-12: 💬 建物が動いた証拠
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論3-12 建物が動いた証拠
; カットイン
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge3-12-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR9,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:写真から見える景色が<br>違うと言いますが、<br>それは本当に<br>同じ場所から<br>撮られたもの<br>なんでしょうか？|#0103Trial12_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"私たちと看守さんは<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_12_01\">身長</link>が違います。<br>それに<br>まったく<link=\"Objection_01_03_12_02\">同じ場所</link>に立って<br>撮ったなんてこと、<br>断言できますかね～？|#0103Trial12_Sherry002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL7,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……でも、<br>中から見える景色は<br>明らかに違っているよ。<br>火精の間の<br>角度がズレてるんだ。|#0103Trial12_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR7,ArmL10,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だからあの建物は……<br>動かされたに<br>違いないよ！|#0103Trial12_Ema002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"いやいや、たしかに<br>動いた可能性はありますけど、<br>誰かが<link=\"Objection_01_03_12_03\">持ち上げた痕跡</link>は<br>ないじゃないですか！<br>地盤が不安定で、<br>角度がズレたのかも<br>しれませんよ？|#0103Trial12_Sherry003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_03_12_04\">トリックがあった</link><br>という推理は<br>私も同意します。<br>でも動かしたとまで<br>決めつけるのは、<br>早計だと思いますけどね～。|#0103Trial12_Sherry004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Surprised_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:たとえば……<br>現段階で<br>トリックの仕掛けが<br>見つけられてないだけの<br>可能性もあるじゃないですか。|#0103Trial12_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Flushed_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_03_12_05\">Ｘ線検査</link>を<br>したわけでもないですし<br>隠し通路なんかある<br>可能性はまだまだあると<br>思うんですよね！|#0103Trial12_Sherry006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL11,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"それとも……<br>私が<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_12_06\">ハンナさんを殺した</link>り、<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_12_07\">あの現場にいた</link><br>という証拠でも<br>あるんですか？|#0103Trial12_Sherry007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR11,ArmL10,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Wink_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:全部エマさんの<br>推測で……<br>証拠なんて<br>何もありませんっ！|#0103Trial12_Sherry008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

